      "id": "lettering_0137",
      "source_lettering_item_id": "lettering_0137",
      "role": "caption",
      "text_by_locale": {
        "source": "That he really knew nothing of the hidden cult, save from what my uncle's relentless catechism had let fall, he soon made clear; and again I strove to think of some way in which he could possibly have received the weird impressions.",
